; Standalone Frama-C kernel + EVA, like upstream's `frama-c` binary: an empty
; main whose behaviour comes from link-time registration, hence -linkall.
; frama-c-eva.core must precede frama-c.boot in (libraries): boot's init
; finalises the command-line option table, so EVA must register first or
; `-eva` is unknown. Run with -no-autoload-plugins (see frama-c.build.sh).
(executable
 (name frama_c_eva)
 (modes exe)
 (flags (:standard -open Frama_c_kernel -linkall))
 (libraries frama-c.kernel frama-c.init.cmdline frama-c-eva.core frama-c.boot))
